# Weathered Runestone: "Nonland permanent cards in graveyards and libraries can't enter the battlefield" (CR 101.2,
# 110.4a). Bot1 casts the Runestone and Repurposing Bay on turn 1. On turn 3 Fabled Passage finds a Forest, a land card in the
# library, which enters: the control. Then the Bay sacrifices Mox Jet (mana value 0) to search for an artifact card with
# mana value 1: Sol Ring, a nonland permanent card in the library, can't be put onto the
# battlefield, so it stays there.

